## 10. Source-quality notes for downstream agents

- Prefer MWAA-published documents (Board resolutions, Official Statements,
  ACFR, design manuals, RFPs) over trade press paraphrase.
- Treat July 29, 2026 announcement paraphrases as **provisional** until the
  underlying Board action, program budget amendment, and airline-consent
  documents are located.
- Do not import "quiet airport" branding claims from peer airports without
  the operating policy, PA specification, and measured passenger-experience
  data behind them.
